1
00:00:12,846 --> 00:00:16,433
This is Ranma from the Saotome
School of Anything Goes Martial Arts.

2
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:19,602
And this is Akane of the Tendo Dojo.

3
00:00:20,729 --> 00:00:23,898
These two teens were arranged
to be married by their parents.

4
00:00:24,524 --> 00:00:26,109
Don't tell me what to do!

5
00:00:26,192 --> 00:00:27,485
You're so annoying.

6
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:31,573
Unfortunately,
Ranma has a bit of a problem.

7
00:00:31,656 --> 00:00:32,824
Hmm?

8
00:00:34,784 --> 00:00:36,453
What the hell was that?

9
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:41,291
When he's splashed with cold water,
he transforms into a girl.

10
00:00:46,296 --> 00:00:50,550
RANMA1/2

11
00:02:12,632 --> 00:02:14,717
SHAMPOO CLEANS UP

12
00:02:14,801 --> 00:02:16,427
The Kiss of Death.

13
00:02:16,511 --> 00:02:19,097
I'll hunt you down to the depths of hell,

14
00:02:19,180 --> 00:02:20,181
and kill you.

15
00:02:20,265 --> 00:02:23,434
Oh, don't worry,
'cause I'm not going anywhere.

16
00:02:24,269 --> 00:02:26,104
I'm putting an end to this here.

17
00:02:31,609 --> 00:02:33,987
Akane!

18
00:02:34,070 --> 00:02:37,073
Akane! Akane! Akane!

19
00:02:37,574 --> 00:02:38,867
Akane!

20
00:02:46,374 --> 00:02:47,542
Akane!

21
00:02:48,334 --> 00:02:51,004
Hey.

22
00:02:52,839 --> 00:02:57,677
Akane!

23
00:03:01,347 --> 00:03:02,640
Akane!

24
00:03:03,474 --> 00:03:04,475
Huh?

25
00:03:05,435 --> 00:03:06,686
What happened?

26
00:03:13,776 --> 00:03:15,862
Do I know you?

27
00:03:17,030 --> 00:03:18,406
Of course you do!

28
00:03:18,489 --> 00:03:20,658
Now what happened between you and Shampoo?

29
00:03:21,451 --> 00:03:22,744
Shampoo...

30
00:03:23,244 --> 00:03:24,746
Uh, Akane?

31
00:03:25,455 --> 00:03:26,748
I remember...

32
00:03:28,124 --> 00:03:30,418
I think I was trying to fight Shampoo.

33
00:03:44,432 --> 00:03:47,060
But what happened after that?

34
00:03:52,065 --> 00:03:55,235
Somehow, my head feels
much more refreshed now.

35
00:03:55,318 --> 00:03:58,488
Hey, Akane. Wait for me.

36
00:03:59,239 --> 00:04:01,699
Uh, you're acting
like I should know you or something.

37
00:04:01,783 --> 00:04:02,659
What?

38
00:04:02,742 --> 00:04:03,868
Who even are you?

39
00:04:03,952 --> 00:04:04,994
Oh, come on...

40
00:04:06,496 --> 00:04:07,622
Hmm?

41
00:04:07,705 --> 00:04:10,458
Sorry, did you and I
meet somewhere before?

42
00:04:10,541 --> 00:04:11,376
Huh?

43
00:04:12,335 --> 00:04:13,336
Hmm.

44
00:04:17,465 --> 00:04:19,676
Wait. No way.

45
00:04:20,885 --> 00:04:22,262
Is it amnesia?

46
00:04:23,096 --> 00:04:24,514
Look! There she is.

47
00:04:24,597 --> 00:04:25,598
Akane!

48
00:04:25,682 --> 00:04:27,392
Oh. Hey, you guys.

49
00:04:28,768 --> 00:04:30,687
We were all worried about you.

50
00:04:30,770 --> 00:04:31,854
Are you okay?

51
00:04:31,938 --> 00:04:33,439
Yeah, I'm totally fine.

52
00:04:33,523 --> 00:04:35,566
Was that Shampoo girl a tough opponent?

53
00:04:36,067 --> 00:04:37,694
I didn't think she was that bad.

54
00:04:38,194 --> 00:04:39,612
Right, P-chan?

55
00:04:39,696 --> 00:04:41,406
You can't be serious right now.

56
00:04:41,489 --> 00:04:43,574
She knocked you out cold.

57
00:04:43,658 --> 00:04:45,368
Again, who even are you?

58
00:04:45,451 --> 00:04:47,328
Oh, please!

59
00:04:47,412 --> 00:04:49,539
Do you know this guy?
He a transfer student?

60
00:04:50,373 --> 00:04:52,333
Huh? What do you mean?

61
00:04:52,417 --> 00:04:53,418
Akane?

62
00:04:54,294 --> 00:04:55,336
Uh...

63
00:04:57,338 --> 00:04:59,841
So, he's my fiancé?

64
00:05:00,758 --> 00:05:03,886
Yeah. You've lived together
for quite a while now.

65
00:05:03,970 --> 00:05:05,471
- It's Ranma!
- Mm-hmm.

66
00:05:05,555 --> 00:05:07,181
There's no way
you're telling me the truth.

67
00:05:07,265 --> 00:05:09,684
Wait. Ranma?

68
00:05:11,769 --> 00:05:13,438
Ran-ma...

69
00:05:14,314 --> 00:05:15,648
Ranma?

70
00:05:17,442 --> 00:05:22,488
Huh? Now that I think about it,
it does sound kinda familiar.

71
00:05:24,657 --> 00:05:27,994
For some weird reason,
it makes me feel nostalgic.

72
00:05:31,247 --> 00:05:32,957
- Akane?
- What's the matter?

73
00:05:35,877 --> 00:05:38,963
That's a lattice or openwork
installed between the lintel and ceiling

74
00:05:39,047 --> 00:05:40,965
to provide ventilation
and lighting, isn't it?

75
00:05:41,049 --> 00:05:42,508
You're thinking of a ranma.

76
00:05:43,009 --> 00:05:46,888
A Latin music of Cuban origin in 2/4 time
with a strong, dynamic beat!

77
00:05:46,971 --> 00:05:48,931
Now you're thinking of a rumba!

78
00:05:49,015 --> 00:05:52,518
What is this?
I'm the only thing she's forgotten about!

79
00:05:53,519 --> 00:05:55,188
I need you to come with me.

80
00:05:55,271 --> 00:05:57,899
Hang on. What are you doing with P-chan?

81
00:05:57,982 --> 00:05:59,525
We're just having a conversation.

82
00:05:59,609 --> 00:06:00,902
Give him back!

83
00:06:00,985 --> 00:06:02,320
Okay.

84
00:06:10,953 --> 00:06:13,164
He moves too well to be just anyone.

85
00:06:13,790 --> 00:06:15,708
Who was the guy that ran away?

86
00:06:15,792 --> 00:06:17,502
I already told you it's Ranma.

87
00:06:18,044 --> 00:06:21,964
Hup, two, three, four!
Hup, two, three, four! Hup!

88
00:06:27,220 --> 00:06:29,680
Tell me everything you saw
in the fight earlier.

89
00:06:30,264 --> 00:06:32,433
What move did Shampoo pull on Akane?

90
00:06:33,810 --> 00:06:36,604
Let me just take a second
to make sure I've got this straight.

91
00:06:36,687 --> 00:06:38,773
You think I'll help Akane remember you?

92
00:06:38,856 --> 00:06:40,441
You bastard!

93
00:06:40,525 --> 00:06:43,444
From where I stand, the way
things are playing out right now

94
00:06:43,528 --> 00:06:45,154
is actually pretty convenient for me.

95
00:06:45,238 --> 00:06:46,614
Uh...

96
00:06:46,697 --> 00:06:48,032
- Hey, ladies!
- ...four!

97
00:06:48,116 --> 00:06:50,201
You wanna see somethin' cool?

98
00:06:51,828 --> 00:06:53,579
Shut the door, you ass!

99
00:06:55,206 --> 00:06:58,209
Anyway, I'm getting goose bumps
just thinking about it.

100
00:07:02,213 --> 00:07:05,049
I mean, the way Shampoo moved her legs...

101
00:07:16,269 --> 00:07:17,979
And that's all I saw.

102
00:07:18,062 --> 00:07:20,022
You know,
you could've saved us some time

103
00:07:20,106 --> 00:07:21,566
and said you didn't see anything.

104
00:07:22,066 --> 00:07:23,818
OSTEOPATHIC CLINIC-CHIROPRACTOR
ACUPUNCTURE-ACUPRESSURE

105
00:07:23,901 --> 00:07:25,486
Hmm.
I don't see an external injury.

106
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:28,656
How did you feel
after you regained consciousness?

107
00:07:28,739 --> 00:07:31,993
Well, I guess it felt
like my head was refreshed.

108
00:07:32,076 --> 00:07:33,744
Huh. I see.

109
00:07:34,579 --> 00:07:36,581
So do you know what it is, Dr. Tofu?

110
00:07:37,206 --> 00:07:39,167
A legendary attack.

111
00:07:39,250 --> 00:07:42,628
The Demon Fist, Xi Fa Shiang Gao Shiatsu.

112
00:07:42,712 --> 00:07:44,380
Huh? What the hell is that?

113
00:07:44,464 --> 00:07:46,007
Huh?

114
00:07:46,090 --> 00:07:47,717
YOU'RE RIGHT!

115
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,594
Oh. Mr. Saotome.

116
00:07:50,303 --> 00:07:52,805
Hang on. You saw the fight, Pops?

117
00:07:52,889 --> 00:07:54,682
THE WHOLE SHEBANG!

118
00:07:57,059 --> 00:07:58,811
Hurry up and turn back into a human!

119
00:07:58,895 --> 00:07:59,896
EVEN NOW AS I...

120
00:08:01,022 --> 00:08:02,398
Oh, it was incredible.

121
00:08:02,482 --> 00:08:04,984
I mean, thinking back on it,
it was quite clear.

122
00:08:05,067 --> 00:08:06,694
This was a divine technique.

123
00:08:12,950 --> 00:08:16,496
The movement of her hands
after slipping behind her opponent

124
00:08:16,579 --> 00:08:18,247
was unlike anything I've ever seen.

125
00:08:26,923 --> 00:08:31,093
It took only 56 seconds
for the whole shampoo, cut and blowout!

126
00:08:31,177 --> 00:08:32,845
Amazing.

127
00:08:33,429 --> 00:08:36,098
So that explains
why my head felt refreshed.

128
00:08:36,182 --> 00:08:39,101
Right. What exactly is this technique?

129
00:08:39,685 --> 00:08:42,522
Xi Fa Shiang Gao Shiatsu
is quite esoteric.

130
00:08:43,022 --> 00:08:46,108
Its user needs to have
a specially blended shampoo.

131
00:08:46,817 --> 00:08:49,695
Then, the fearsome technique
uses pressure points on the head

132
00:08:49,779 --> 00:08:51,656
to manipulate the victim's memory.

133
00:08:52,573 --> 00:08:55,493
Oh! That must be why
you don't remember me at all.

134
00:08:55,576 --> 00:08:56,911
Who are you again?

135
00:08:56,994 --> 00:08:58,913
Is there any way we can cure this?

136
00:08:58,996 --> 00:09:03,084
First off, we'll need to get our hands on
that shampoo she used on you.

137
00:09:03,167 --> 00:09:05,169
All right. Come on, Akane.

138
00:09:05,253 --> 00:09:06,629
What's happening?

139
00:09:07,838 --> 00:09:10,383
Shampoo! Hey!

140
00:09:10,967 --> 00:09:13,719
- Where are you?
- What the hell is wrong with you?

141
00:09:14,345 --> 00:09:16,430
Give me the shampoo!

142
00:09:17,181 --> 00:09:19,267
Shampoo!

143
00:09:19,350 --> 00:09:21,811
I have returned.

144
00:09:22,395 --> 00:09:23,771
Hello.

145
00:09:23,854 --> 00:09:26,232
Also, this is the new apprentice nurse.

146
00:09:26,315 --> 00:09:28,693
Shampoo will now be living here
as a tenant.

147
00:09:28,776 --> 00:09:30,278
SMALL WORLD... ISN'T IT?

148
00:09:33,072 --> 00:09:34,532
I'm home now.

149
00:09:36,284 --> 00:09:37,868
Akane!

150
00:09:37,952 --> 00:09:40,204
I heard that you don't remember Ranma
anymore.

151
00:09:41,205 --> 00:09:43,165
Ranma? Who is that again?

152
00:09:43,666 --> 00:09:45,835
Put it to you this way.

153
00:09:46,335 --> 00:09:48,754
Who's that guy standing behind you?
Right there.

154
00:09:49,255 --> 00:09:50,256
Huh?

155
00:09:52,341 --> 00:09:55,553
Hey! What makes you think you have
the right to follow me into my house?

156
00:09:55,636 --> 00:09:57,763
Uh, well, I kinda live here.

157
00:09:57,847 --> 00:09:58,931
Oh, wow.

158
00:09:59,015 --> 00:10:01,267
So she really forgot all about him, huh?

159
00:10:03,728 --> 00:10:06,230
Everything is going to be
just fine, Akane.

160
00:10:07,106 --> 00:10:10,192
That is as long as you haven't forgotten
about me, of course.

161
00:10:10,276 --> 00:10:11,527
Who are you, Mister?

162
00:10:13,029 --> 00:10:15,656
Dad, I was just kidding.
You don't have to cry.

163
00:10:15,740 --> 00:10:17,325
Yeah, she's doin' okay.

164
00:10:17,408 --> 00:10:18,868
Damn it.

165
00:10:18,951 --> 00:10:20,953
Where could Shampoo have run off to?

166
00:10:21,454 --> 00:10:22,288
GUESS WHO?

167
00:10:22,371 --> 00:10:25,750
Why did you do that,
you crazy old ma...

168
00:10:25,833 --> 00:10:26,917
HOO HOO! HE FELL FOR IT!

169
00:10:27,001 --> 00:10:29,170
You fell for it!
You fell for it!

170
00:10:29,253 --> 00:10:31,464
Shampoo, you're being such a...

171
00:10:32,006 --> 00:10:33,424
Wo de ai ren.

172
00:10:37,637 --> 00:10:38,971
What are you doing?

173
00:10:39,472 --> 00:10:40,890
Uh, so who are you again?

174
00:10:41,390 --> 00:10:43,017
You're telling me...

175
00:10:43,100 --> 00:10:45,519
I don't understand what happened.

176
00:10:45,603 --> 00:10:48,773
The moment I saw the two of them hugging,
I lost my temper.

177
00:10:49,523 --> 00:10:51,734
An unconscious reflex.

178
00:10:51,817 --> 00:10:55,196
Somewhere deep down inside of her heart,
she still remembers Ranma.

179
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:58,282
Hang on. Are you that thing
we put on top of ramen?

180
00:10:58,366 --> 00:11:00,076
Now you're thinking of menma.

181
00:11:00,159 --> 00:11:02,787
My technique
must not have been fully effective.

182
00:11:03,287 --> 00:11:04,872
She's a formidable woman.

183
00:11:05,373 --> 00:11:07,166
So I'll just try again!

184
00:11:07,249 --> 00:11:09,627
Xi Fa Shiang Gao Shiatsu!

185
00:11:13,464 --> 00:11:16,050
Okay.
Now that I've gotten this shampoo...

186
00:11:16,550 --> 00:11:18,010
Ai ren!

187
00:11:22,264 --> 00:11:24,558
Ow, ow, ow, that hurts!

188
00:11:24,642 --> 00:11:27,019
What do you think you're doing?

189
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:29,605
That shampoo won't work, Ranma.

190
00:11:29,689 --> 00:11:30,564
Trust me.

191
00:11:30,648 --> 00:11:32,400
You're in on this, Doctor?

192
00:11:32,483 --> 00:11:35,111
Just take a look
at the blend number printed on the bottle.

193
00:11:36,737 --> 00:11:38,322
It's one, one, zero.

194
00:11:38,406 --> 00:11:40,825
If our aim is to recover her lost memory,

195
00:11:40,908 --> 00:11:44,245
you need to find a bottle
with blend number 119 printed on it.

196
00:11:44,328 --> 00:11:45,329
Mm-hmm.

197
00:11:45,413 --> 00:11:47,289
Well, where do I get that?

198
00:11:47,373 --> 00:11:49,083
There's no need to worry.

199
00:11:49,583 --> 00:11:51,419
We can find the formula in this book.

200
00:11:51,502 --> 00:11:55,673
Wonderful, Doctor!
So Akane can be cured with that, right?

201
00:11:55,756 --> 00:11:57,091
Oh, Kasumi.

202
00:11:57,591 --> 00:12:00,177
It's so good to see you,
but what are you doing here?

203
00:12:00,261 --> 00:12:03,180
Doctor, you're the one
who came to my house.

204
00:12:03,264 --> 00:12:05,141
Oh, right, it's your house.

205
00:12:05,224 --> 00:12:06,392
Okay, I get it now--

206
00:12:06,475 --> 00:12:09,770
Why are you tearing it up
if we need that?

207
00:12:14,650 --> 00:12:17,528
So what's happened this time
that's making you pack up, Ranma?

208
00:12:17,611 --> 00:12:19,780
I thought it was pretty obvious.

209
00:12:20,489 --> 00:12:24,452
I'm going to a drugstore in China
to buy shampoo 119.

210
00:12:24,535 --> 00:12:25,828
Yay!

211
00:12:25,911 --> 00:12:27,705
Bring me back a souvenir, okay?

212
00:12:27,788 --> 00:12:28,789
HOW ABOUT SOME GRECIAN FORMULA?

213
00:12:28,873 --> 00:12:30,624
- ...oolong tea.
- ...some Shanghai crab...

214
00:12:30,708 --> 00:12:33,335
- ...all the cigarettes you can...
- ...some rice crackers...

215
00:12:35,171 --> 00:12:38,924
I don't get it. Why is this guy
so desperate to help me?

216
00:12:39,842 --> 00:12:40,968
Hey, Akane.

217
00:12:43,095 --> 00:12:44,138
Just wait for me.

218
00:12:44,221 --> 00:12:46,807
You're definitely gonna remember me
by the end of this.

219
00:12:50,603 --> 00:12:52,772
Oh, Ranma, my boy!

220
00:12:52,855 --> 00:12:53,689
Thank you so much...

221
00:12:53,773 --> 00:12:55,274
BRINGS A TEAR TO YOUR EYE,
DON'T IT?

222
00:12:55,357 --> 00:12:56,817
There's no need to hold back.

223
00:12:56,901 --> 00:12:58,194
Say it with your chest!

224
00:12:58,277 --> 00:12:59,612
Oh, man.

225
00:12:59,695 --> 00:13:01,947
I don't know what it is about him...

226
00:13:04,950 --> 00:13:07,286
but it makes me want to remember
who he is.

227
00:13:09,538 --> 00:13:12,666
Now I just need to figure out
how to get to China for free.

228
00:13:13,334 --> 00:13:16,504
I'll probably have to swim there
like I did with Dad the last time.

229
00:13:17,046 --> 00:13:19,882
It's not gonna be easy,
but I don't have a choice.

230
00:13:20,674 --> 00:13:22,927
That's the only way
I can get the 119 stuff.

231
00:13:24,887 --> 00:13:27,515
Whoa!

232
00:13:28,265 --> 00:13:29,266
Hmm?

233
00:13:31,101 --> 00:13:33,979
One, one, nine?

234
00:13:34,563 --> 00:13:35,773
Gimme that!

235
00:13:37,733 --> 00:13:39,902
Wait right there. Shampoo!

236
00:13:49,203 --> 00:13:50,037
Hmm?

237
00:13:52,248 --> 00:13:53,249
Huh?

238
00:13:54,542 --> 00:13:55,668
Come get it.

239
00:13:55,751 --> 00:13:58,879
You think something like this
is gonna scare me out of a challenge?

240
00:13:58,963 --> 00:14:01,924
You might not believe it, but
I'm very familiar with the female body!

241
00:14:02,007 --> 00:14:04,343
So I'm getting what I want!

242
00:14:04,426 --> 00:14:07,596
Ah! Not like that! I'm sorry!

243
00:14:12,184 --> 00:14:15,020
Fine! Why don't we try this, then?

244
00:14:15,104 --> 00:14:17,398
I owe you a massive favor.
Whatever you want.

245
00:14:17,481 --> 00:14:19,149
You mean it?

246
00:14:19,692 --> 00:14:21,569
On my honor as a man.

247
00:14:21,652 --> 00:14:25,489
I'll do anything but the limit is that you
can't ask me to kill Akane or marry you.

248
00:14:27,408 --> 00:14:28,492
Fine.

249
00:14:29,368 --> 00:14:30,202
Huh?

250
00:14:32,997 --> 00:14:35,916
The girl Ranma. Kill her instead.

251
00:14:36,792 --> 00:14:37,918
Huh?

252
00:14:43,966 --> 00:14:45,259
DOJO ENTRANCE THIS WAY

253
00:14:45,342 --> 00:14:46,635
Just so I'm clear,

254
00:14:47,219 --> 00:14:50,723
Shampoo doesn't get that you
and female Ranma are the same person?

255
00:14:50,806 --> 00:14:53,058
Nope. I'm pretty sure she does not.

256
00:14:54,310 --> 00:14:59,440
If you end female Ranma's life for me,
I give you shampoo 119 in return.

257
00:15:00,316 --> 00:15:01,567
Do we have a deal?

258
00:15:02,234 --> 00:15:03,652
Yeah. I gotcha.

259
00:15:03,736 --> 00:15:06,238
But do you think we could settle
for a half-kill?

260
00:15:06,822 --> 00:15:09,325
I don't understand
what that means, but okay.

261
00:15:09,408 --> 00:15:12,036
So, yeah, that about covers it.

262
00:15:12,119 --> 00:15:13,996
Ryoga, I want you to beat me up.

263
00:15:14,079 --> 00:15:15,289
I'm not doing that.

264
00:15:15,873 --> 00:15:17,291
You should accept reality

265
00:15:17,374 --> 00:15:19,960
and let me be the one
to take care of Akane.

266
00:15:20,544 --> 00:15:23,297
This could be the starting point
of our blossoming love! Mmm.

267
00:15:23,380 --> 00:15:25,716
Ranma? Who is that again?

268
00:15:26,258 --> 00:15:28,886
Ha! He's not worth remembering, my sweet.

269
00:15:32,014 --> 00:15:33,849
I'm politely asking you to help.

270
00:15:33,933 --> 00:15:35,976
And I already told you no!

271
00:15:36,060 --> 00:15:39,396
Come on, let's keep this going.
I've been begging you to beat me up.

272
00:15:44,693 --> 00:15:46,820
Then I'll beat you to death!

273
00:15:46,904 --> 00:15:48,739
Yeah, now you're gettin' it!

274
00:15:54,203 --> 00:15:58,165
Oh, you idiot.
You weren't supposed to collapse yet!

275
00:15:58,248 --> 00:16:00,250
How am I supposed to recover
Akane's memory

276
00:16:00,334 --> 00:16:02,044
if you don't beat the crap out of me?

277
00:16:02,127 --> 00:16:04,088
We can be the ones to help!

278
00:16:04,630 --> 00:16:05,631
IT'S ALL SO SWEET!

279
00:16:05,714 --> 00:16:09,343
It just means so much
that you'd go this far for Akane, Ranma!

280
00:16:09,426 --> 00:16:10,594
What are you doing?

281
00:16:11,595 --> 00:16:13,347
Akane. Look!

282
00:16:13,430 --> 00:16:15,349
Look at this man and be amazed!

283
00:16:15,432 --> 00:16:16,850
It's a monster!

284
00:16:16,934 --> 00:16:18,352
Who you callin' a monster?

285
00:16:18,435 --> 00:16:20,104
Well, what the heck are you then?

286
00:16:20,729 --> 00:16:21,730
Hmm?

287
00:16:22,690 --> 00:16:23,774
Hyah!

288
00:16:25,567 --> 00:16:28,445
Dad! You know you shouldn't be
picking on weaklings.

289
00:16:28,529 --> 00:16:30,322
So I'll fight you in his place.

290
00:16:30,406 --> 00:16:31,865
Hey...

291
00:16:31,949 --> 00:16:34,243
- Hmm?
- Stay out of this, you idiot.

292
00:16:34,326 --> 00:16:35,828
Why should I?

293
00:16:35,911 --> 00:16:36,912
Oh, come on!

294
00:16:36,996 --> 00:16:39,873
Who do you think I'm getting beat up for
in the first place?

295
00:16:39,957 --> 00:16:41,750
Mmm?

296
00:16:41,834 --> 00:16:44,670
I don't know why I'm surprised.
This is why you're not cute!

297
00:16:44,753 --> 00:16:47,464
Not cute! ...cute! ...cute!

298
00:16:47,548 --> 00:16:49,174
So I'm not cute?

299
00:16:49,258 --> 00:16:50,259
Hmm?

300
00:16:51,051 --> 00:16:52,845
- Huh...
- Mmm?

301
00:16:54,054 --> 00:16:55,514
Ah. Hold on.

302
00:16:56,598 --> 00:16:58,100
Ranma, say that again.

303
00:16:58,642 --> 00:16:59,935
You're not cute!

304
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:02,479
Say it again!

305
00:17:02,563 --> 00:17:04,189
You're not cute!

306
00:17:04,273 --> 00:17:06,442
You're not cute!

307
00:17:06,525 --> 00:17:07,735
She's responding.

308
00:17:07,818 --> 00:17:10,821
Onward, Ranma! Break through to her
with your soul-stirring words!

309
00:17:10,904 --> 00:17:12,948
Well, if that's what you want, I got this.

310
00:17:13,032 --> 00:17:16,910
You're not sexy. You're a
vicious, klutzy dork that's totally flat!

311
00:17:16,994 --> 00:17:19,246
You bastard!

312
00:17:19,329 --> 00:17:21,665
How dare you
throw those awful words at Akane?

313
00:17:21,749 --> 00:17:23,292
Oh, great. You're still alive.

314
00:17:23,792 --> 00:17:25,127
You're not cute!

315
00:17:25,210 --> 00:17:26,628
You're not cute!

316
00:17:26,712 --> 00:17:28,213
You're not cute.

317
00:17:28,297 --> 00:17:29,465
You're not cute!

318
00:17:29,548 --> 00:17:30,716
You're not cute!

319
00:17:30,799 --> 00:17:31,967
You're not cute!

320
00:17:32,051 --> 00:17:34,219
You're not sexy. This isn't sexy.

321
00:17:34,303 --> 00:17:35,471
Not very sexy.

322
00:17:35,554 --> 00:17:36,722
That's not sexy!

323
00:17:36,805 --> 00:17:37,973
You're not sexy.

324
00:17:38,057 --> 00:17:42,978
You're not sexy!
You're not sexy! You're not sexy...

325
00:17:44,521 --> 00:17:47,858
What the hell is wrong with you, Ranma?

326
00:17:58,786 --> 00:18:02,164
Akane! You remembered him! Ranma!

327
00:18:04,750 --> 00:18:07,044
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm! The miracle of love.

328
00:18:07,127 --> 00:18:08,796
You're heavy.

329
00:18:08,879 --> 00:18:09,797
Huh?

330
00:18:15,385 --> 00:18:16,887
- Ah!
- Hello.

331
00:18:17,471 --> 00:18:18,639
Shampoo?

332
00:18:19,723 --> 00:18:21,350
Ah! Ai ren?

333
00:18:21,433 --> 00:18:24,144
- Ai ren!
- Whoa!

334
00:18:25,938 --> 00:18:26,939
Hmm?

335
00:18:32,736 --> 00:18:34,696
So, you've remembered Ranma.

336
00:18:34,780 --> 00:18:36,490
You are a persistent one.

337
00:18:36,573 --> 00:18:38,867
Yeah, well, right back at you!

338
00:18:39,576 --> 00:18:40,786
Then I have no choice.

339
00:18:41,286 --> 00:18:42,621
If you didn't remember him,

340
00:18:42,704 --> 00:18:44,331
you wouldn't have to die!

341
00:18:52,172 --> 00:18:53,882
Shampoo, stop this.

342
00:18:54,925 --> 00:18:57,803
Wo ai ni.

343
00:18:58,303 --> 00:18:59,888
Just hang on a second.

344
00:18:59,972 --> 00:19:02,474
You promised.
You said you wouldn't hurt Akane.

345
00:19:02,975 --> 00:19:05,853
Remove the obstacle.
It's the natural order of things.

346
00:19:07,146 --> 00:19:09,106
There's no choice.

347
00:19:09,898 --> 00:19:11,567
I have to tell you the truth.

348
00:19:25,164 --> 00:19:27,291
You female Ranma?

349
00:19:30,961 --> 00:19:33,255
Yeah. Coming out like this is hard.

350
00:19:33,755 --> 00:19:36,008
But the male form is just temporary.

351
00:19:36,592 --> 00:19:40,304
Check 'em out. I've been hiding
that I'm actually a girl.

352
00:19:45,017 --> 00:19:46,059
I HAD NO IDEA!

353
00:19:46,143 --> 00:19:50,564
So, yeah, I guess
my relationship with you is, uh...

354
00:19:56,153 --> 00:19:58,030
Die!

355
00:19:59,823 --> 00:20:02,534
Oh, wait, wait, wait, wait.

356
00:20:13,420 --> 00:20:14,504
Mmm.

357
00:20:36,235 --> 00:20:37,236
Bié le.

358
00:20:48,121 --> 00:20:49,581
Shampoo.

359
00:20:56,588 --> 00:20:57,673
"Bié le."

360
00:20:59,132 --> 00:21:01,218
It's the Chinese word for "farewell."

361
00:21:02,386 --> 00:21:06,265
Which I'm guessing means
that you'll never see that girl again.

362
00:21:10,394 --> 00:21:12,187
You know, it's never too late.

363
00:21:12,271 --> 00:21:14,356
You should turn back into a man
and stop her.

364
00:21:14,898 --> 00:21:16,066
Oh, shut up.

365
00:21:26,410 --> 00:21:29,955
Still, it's kind of a waste to let her go.
